#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Find cut locations, given a maximum of 4 qubits per subcircuit. This circuit"
" can be separated in two by making a single wire cut and cutting one "
"`CRZGate` {#find-cut-locations-given-a-maximum-of-4-qubits-per-subcircuit-"
"this-circuit-can-be-separated-in-two-by-making-a-single-wire-cut-and-"
"cutting-one-crzgate}"
msgstr ""
"サブ回路あたり最大4 Qubitという条件のもと、カット位置を検出します。この Circuit は、ワイヤーカットを1か所と `CRZGate` "
"のカットを1か所行うことで2つに分割できます {#find-cut-locations-given-a-maximum-of-4-qubits-per-"
"subcircuit-this-circuit-can-be-separated-in-two-by-making-a-single-wire-cut-"
"and-cutting-one-crzgate}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
