#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Add ancillas for wire cuts and expand the observables to account for ancilla"
" qubits {#add-ancillas-for-wire-cuts-and-expand-the-observables-to-account-"
"for-ancilla-qubits}"
msgstr ""
"ワイヤーカット用の補助ビットを追加し、補助 qubit を考慮してオブザーバブルを拡張する {#add-ancillas-for-wire-cuts-"
"and-expand-the-observables-to-account-for-ancilla-qubits}"

#. type: Plain text
