#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Partition the circuit and observables into subcircuits and subobservables. "
"Calculate the sampling overhead incurred from cutting these gates and wires."
" {#partition-the-circuit-and-observables-into-subcircuits-and-"
"subobservables-calculate-the-sampling-overhead-incurred-from-cutting-these-"
"gates-and-wires}"
msgstr ""
"Circuit とオブザーバブルをサブ回路とサブオブザーバブルに分割します。これらの Gate "
"とワイヤーをカットすることで生じるサンプリング・オーバーヘッドを計算します。 {#partition-the-circuit-and-"
"observables-into-subcircuits-and-subobservables-calculate-the-sampling-"
"overhead-incurred-from-cutting-these-gates-and-wires}"

